WEBVTT

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.980
If that's the case, we can't work at the Maho-dou...

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.990
Or be apprentices anymore?

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.600
Even the fairies...

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.540
Will have to go.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.310
No waaaaay!

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.770
Pinch! The Teacher Found Out!!

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.560
You're in a good mood since you passed the level 9 test, Doremi-chan.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.230
Yep, now we can continue our witch apprentice practice.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.920
The Maho-dou earned quite a lotta money too.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.880
Every day is so much fun!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:37.630
Yep.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:42.090
Now if only the school assigned less homework...

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.410
Doremi-chan, yer so greedy.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.170
I'm just saying...

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.910
Wow! You've got so many pictures of pretty shops.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.590
Wow, you're right.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.850
As expected from our 3rd grade journalist.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.200
Where did you take them?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:11.200
We're doing a special report about beautiful shops around the school.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.130
That's why we took a lot of pictures, but...

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.920
Ah? Look at this!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.730
Isn't that Doremi-chan and her friends?

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.630
Look! This picture...

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.630
You think so, too?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:26.010
I noticed that after the picture was developed.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.580
Yeah, I'm sure.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.520
But, are they working in this shop?

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.230
And why?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.900
Let me see.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.060
Reika-chan.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.240
Hmm? This is a picture of them working part-time.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.530
What are those girls thinking?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.990
This is clearly against the rules.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.960
Good morning!

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.090
What? Did something happen?

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.090
Oh, nothing happened at all.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.010
What's with her deal, that Tamaki Reika!?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.760
Hey, Doremi-chan.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.310
Are you by any chance working part-time?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.060
Ehhh!?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.780
The next hour is study hall, got it?
Blackboard: Study Hall

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.490
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.620
Harukaze.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.800
Fujiwara.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.560
Senoo.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.620
Will you all come with me?

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:49.100
Teacher, why does the principal want to see us?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:54.350
There's a photo of you girls working in a shop.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.650
So that's what it was.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.410
Tamaki-san turned us in!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.760
That was mean...

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.240
Is it true, Teacher?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.450
It doesn't matter who said what.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.750
But is it true?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.740
About you guys working part-time?

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.180
We're not working!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:17.220
Right! We ain't gettin' any money!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.710
We're just helpin' out!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.990
Helping? Who are you helping?

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.210
I-It's...

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.850
Ai-chan's aunt's niece's...

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.930
...grandma!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.170
Is that so?

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:32.950
Come in.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.430
Excuse us.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:40.750
Not a part-time job?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:45.010
But the proof is right here, is it not?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.640
Well, there seems to be a misunderstanding.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.240
She's right! It's not a part-time job!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.990
We're just helpin' out a relative!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.080
Please don't forbid us to go!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.820
A relative?

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:58.880
What kind of a relative, Seki-sensei?

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:03.300
Um... it's Senoo Aiko's aunt's niece's...

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.540
Grandma.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.260
That grandma isn't feeling well.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.560
So they are only helping her take care of the store.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:18.190
Yeah, we don't get paid. We don't even have any allowance.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.890
E-Even so... But you...

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:25.360
They're only helping a relative. I think it's alright, Mr. Principal.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.570
Yes, I agree.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.030
Mr. Principal!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.490
Then, we can keep on helping her, can't we?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.620
Of course.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.170
Yay! Thank you, Mr. Principal!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.460
What a relief.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.040
I was so worried.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.230
My, my...

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.130
Pass the ball.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:56.890
Pass it over.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.350
This way! This way!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.230
Hey! Over here, over here!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:00.940
No!

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.810
Here!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.110
Got it!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.820
It's been too long. I wonder if they're alright?

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:11.490
You know that elementary students can't work part-time.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:16.790
They must be getting quite a scolding from the principal and the vice principal.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.560
But we feel bad for them...

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.050
You don't need to sympathize with those rule-breakers.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.040
My bad, my bad!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.950
What are you doing!? That hurt, you know!

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:31.010
And how dare you play ball in the classroom!? I'll tell the teacher!

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:35.050
You're a real tattle-tale, you know?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.110
What did you say?

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.060
What happened to Doremi and her friends must be your handiwork.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.050
I was only performing my duty as the class representative.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.920
Furthermore, are you taking their side, Kotake-kun?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.740
D-D-D-Dummy, who'd want to take their side!?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:54.030
Ah, but Kotake-kun, you're blushing!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.180
Don't tell me you like one of those girls?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.950
No, I don't!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.370
Ta-da!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.200
Sorry fer the wait!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.670
Hey, hey, hey! How was it?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.570
Are you alright?

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:07.750
What about your part-time job?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.490
It's alright, everyone.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.880
It wasn't a part-time job after all.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.340
Yeah! We're only helpin' out an old relative.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.800
The principal said there's no problem.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.310
Wow, that's great.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.770
Hey, hey, we'd like to visit your store, too.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:33.810
Sure! It's called the Maho-dou. We're there every Saturday and Sunday.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.160
Yay!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.060
The principal gave us permission.

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.920
Now we can work more openly.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.210
And with our magic practice too.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.470
That has to be a lie about not working.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.790
Listen, you have to find proof.

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:58.670
Fine...

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.190
Hey!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:02.980
Harukaze!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:03.640
Fujiwara!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.300
Senoo!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.440
Teacher, what is it?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:13.720
The vice principal and I will visit the store you're helping at later.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:19.530
He insisted on talking to Senoo's aunt's...

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.920
...niece's grandma.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:24.840
Yes. He wants to meet her and talk to her.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.160
We'll be there soon, so wait for us.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:29.880
Oh no!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.070
What are we going to do?

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.630
We gotta come up with a plan soon!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.570
This is getting interesting!

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:38.900
Let's get going.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:39.820
Yeah...

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:40.960
Tamaki!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:41.640
Shimakura!

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.440
Yes, what is it?

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:52.360
Tamaki, that wasn't nice of you to go to the vice principal without checking with me first.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.630
Remember to tell me first next time.

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.200
Understand?

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.080
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.800
Shimakura, you too, don't be so obsessed on something so trivial.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:02.490
Yes, ma'am...

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.190
Don't do things so impulsively.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:10.430
What was that!? I was scolded because of your lousy pictures!

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:14.460
I've never been scolded by the teachers before!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:19.910
How could you say that!? I was only taking the pictures! It was you...

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:23.310
That's it, it's all Harukaze-san and her friends' fault.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.790
I'm not letting them get away with this.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.350
Neither am I.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.130
With that, we must investigate this further!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.530
Ahh, there's not enough time!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.320
I'm home!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.990
I'm leaving!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.780
Doremi, your snack!

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.780
Doremi doesn't want her snack?

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.550
Maybe there'll be a freak snowstorm...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.550
T-The teachers aren't here yet, are they?

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:52.190
I don't think so.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:53.540
Gotta hurry!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.960
Majo Rika!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:22.080
What!? What's with this letter!?

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.530
Why!?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.910
Of all the times...!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.370
Why now!?

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.940
I won a one-day trip to the hot springs from the Witch World's lottery.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.390
I'm taking Lala with me. I'll leave everything to you.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.880
A trip to the hot springs!?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:42.340
How are we gonna get through this without Majo Rika?

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.430
We'll have to find someone to pose as that Grandma.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:51.170
Ahhh! Find!? Where are we going to find one!?

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:52.390
This ain't no time to cry.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:55.450
What now?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.050
~ A mobile store, I bring sugar, the latest, and such more!
They call me Dela! ~

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.820
Dela.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.490
What the? Oh no, I'm stuck.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.460
Wait a sec.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:22.910
Dela...

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:31.140
Wait, why do I have to dress like this?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:35.400
It ain't gonna do ya any good if the Maho-dou's outta business, right?

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.100
That's why ya gotta help.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.950
You just sit there quietly. All you have to do is nod when someone talks to you.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.740
In that case, there's no problem.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.200
How about paying me this much?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.610
We'll pay, we'll pay!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.040
We'll pay, so ya gonna do it?

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.000
Then I'll do it.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.570
That's great.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.830
You girls go back to your crystal balls, okay?

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.000
Maho-dou...

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.930
This is it, Mr. Vice Principal. This is the place.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.840
What an interesting store.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.150
Welcome to the Maho-dou!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.610
Hello! We're here!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.240
You guys made all these?

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.580
Yes, we did!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.540
Oh, how interesting...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:40.130
We made them while wishing our buyers to be happy.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:41.820
Seki-sensei.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:43.780
How 'bout this?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:45.250
It's made with a love charm.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.050
Yer gonna meet the man of yer dreams with this!

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:48.990
Really!?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:53.220
Hey, you shouldn't lie to adults!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:03.820
Excuse me, are you Senoo Aiko-san's aunt's niece's grandma?

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:08.010
Mr. Vice Principal, actually, grandma caught a cold.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:11.490
The doctor told her not to talk, so she won't affect others.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.950
That's terrible.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:18.420
Well, these kids aren't working part-time, are they?

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.880
And you don't pay them?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:26.120
See, Mr. Vice Principal. They weren't lying.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:27.340
I think that's enough.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.190
Grandma, wait!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.390
Grandma goes to the bathroom a lot.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.670
W-What are you doing, Dela?

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.690
We're not finished here, yet.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:46.340
Time's up. I have to visit my other customers.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:52.160
I'll bill you at the end of the month along with what you owed already.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.880
See ya!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:54.870
Dela!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.180
What are we going to do?

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.110
She didn't have to take the clothes with her!

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:03.450
We have no choice, Hadzuki-chan.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.760
Change me into grandma with your magic.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.920
Eh? But I don't know if I can do it.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.840
We don't have time to dilly-dally. Come on, hurry up!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:11.790
Okay!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.000
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:31.110
Grandma always takes a long time in the bathroom.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.930
I guess they're helpin' her.

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:49.170
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.400
Change Doremi-chan into grandma!

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.740
Please work!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.940
Hadzuki-chan, that's great!

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.400
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.570
Eh? Where is Harukaze?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.550
S-She's in the bathroom.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.200
What's goin' on?

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:15.770
What is it?

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.700
Nothing.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.070
Come on, Grandma, sit down.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.730
Could you please sign here?

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:29.800
This is to prove they're not working for you, that they volunteered to help.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.590
Right here.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.300
T-The magic is fading.

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:37.520
Wait!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:38.310
What's wrong?

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.980
Ah, you've changed back!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.650
Then, this time it's Doremi-chan's turn to change me.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.400
I guess I have to do it.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.910
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:07.260
Grandma had to go to the bathroom again.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:17.430
Ta-da!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.390
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.610
Change Hadzuki-chan into grandma!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.970
Ahh! Let me try again!

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.780
Alright! This time for sure!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.780
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.280
Change Hadzuki-chan into grandma!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.840
Ahhh! A sumo wrestler!?

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:55.800
I wonder what's wrong with grandma?

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.470
I'll go check it out.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.760
Hey, you...

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.200
After I, the vice principal, paid a special visit...

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.960
It's so impolite.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.730
What's with the sumo outfit?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.000
Thank goodness...

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.890
Ai-chan, help us!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.620
If we don't hurry, the teachers are gonna be suspicious.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.500
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.590
Harukaze-san, Fujiwara-san, Senoo-san!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:33.580
Coming!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.170
Please wait for a moment.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.170
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.560
Change into grandma!

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.610
We're twins!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:00.030
Come on! Doesn't matter who goes!

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:02.280
Alright, thank you.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.000
So now there's no problem, right Mr. Vice Principal?

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:05.610
Yes.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.290
Goin' to the bathroom again, Grandma?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.830
Wait, I still have something else to ask you...

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.230
Mr. Vice Principal!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:17.130
Leave the rest to me. Please go on back.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.630
Yes, but...

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:21.720
Mr. Vice Principal, you must have other things to do.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.550
Go, go, go, go!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.640
Seki-sensei, I...

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.800
Go, go, go, go!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.860
Well okay, please take care of the rest, Seki-sensei.

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:34.710
Harukaze, Fujiwara, Senoo.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.820
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:40.950
How did you know, Teacher?

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.660
I thought so.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.190
I don't know where you got her...

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:49.020
But that old lady is not your relative, right?

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.870
No...

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.330
Why did you lie even to me?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.730
You don't even trust your own teacher?

00:19:57.810 --> 00:19:59.290
I'm so disappointed.

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:00.450
It's not that, Teacher!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.040
We trust you, Seki-sensei, and we're counting on you.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.150
What she said!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.440
But this is a very complicated matter.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.430
What is it?

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.610
Teacher, we can't tell ya even if you are our teacher. Ya hafta forgive us.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:16.900
But we never did anything wrong.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.250
Please believe us.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:19.940
Please.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.120
I see, I believe you.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:29.770
And you won't tell the principal and vice principal?

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:30.830
No, but...

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:32.990
Mama.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.570
Dad.

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.120
You should let your parents know what you're doing.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:39.060
Yes, ma'am...

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.990
I think you all must be very surprised.

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.820
But they're helping an old lady.

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:50.480
They're taking care of the store for her.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:56.360
They didn't know how to tell you.

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.400
But, I think they're doing a very good thing.

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:04.660
As their teacher, I'm asking you to let them keep on helping here.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:09.960
Hadzuki-chan, you're such a gentle and amazing girl.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.040
Mama.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:16.400
Aiko, why didn't ya say so earlier?

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.840
Dad ain't gonna stop ya.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:23.090
So it's okay? Dad, thanks a lot!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:26.620
So this is why you get up so early on Sunday?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.610
But keep it up! Mom will support you.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:34.560
Your father will be very surprised.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.560
Yay!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.020
It's okay with them.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.170
I'm so happy.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.450
Mom, thank you!

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.300
We're back.

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.260
What's going on?

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:53.790
Who knows.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.540
So, about Marina-chan...

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:05.620
I'm Fujiwara Hadzuki, a third grade student of class two.

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.960
Koizumi Marina-san is in the same class.

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:13.060
She comes first every day, cleans the classroom and helps the teacher arrange flowers.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:20.150
But Kimura-kun called Koizumi-san a teacher's pet, so she's hurt and won't ever arrange the flowers again.

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:22.570
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:25.410
Early Riser Girl Marina and a Bouquet From the Heart.

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:28.860
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
